        ],
        "geometry_estimated": true,
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "epistle-line-36",
            "text": "„Аще ли вѣры томоу не имєте, но клѧноу сѧ вам, тако ми",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              117,
              1422,
              973,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-iv-102-image-20261126",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 54,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "epistle-line-37",
            "text": "мыс’ца моя высокая и ст҃ыⷯ моиⷯ аг҃глъ, єже бо тїи мл҃ѧт и[ма]",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              117,
              1458,
              973,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-iv-102-image-20261126",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 62,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "epistle-line-38",
            "text": "моє за вес мир, како не зинєт земля и не пожрет вас, — аз ѡвращоу",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              117,
              1494,
              973,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-iv-102-image-20261126",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 65,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "epistle-line-39",
            "text": "лице своє ѿ вас за злыя грѣхи ваша, єже сътвористе скоупостїю,",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              117,
              1530,
              973,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-iv-102-image-20261126",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 62,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "epistle-line-40",
            "text": "а не млⷭрдїєⷨ нищим. таковїи анаѳема, прокляти сꙋт и прїимоут",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              117,
              1566,
              973,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-iv-102-image-20261126",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 61,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "epistle-line-41",
            "text": "въ дн҃ь суда моєго м’здоу. чада ваша ѡбыидоут в’сю землю",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              117,
              1602,
              973,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-iv-102-image-20261126",
